02721                     {\cf19 continue};\par
02722             {\cf19 if} (column->MaxX <= column->ClipRect.Min.x) {\cf20 // FIXME-TABLE FIXME-STYLE: Assume BorderSize==1, this is problematic if we want to increase the border size..}\par
02723                 {\cf19 continue};\par
